<title>GERMANY: GOLF-EUROPEAN TOURNAMENT PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-EUROPEAN TOURNAMENT PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</headline>
